      "name": "[SAIN]-Live-in-Norvinsk-Preset",
      "slug": "sain-live-in-norvinsk-preset",
      "teaser": "The goal of this preset is to make the bots in Tarkov less like bots and more like humans.\r\n这个预设的目标是让塔科夫里的BOT不那么像BOT，而更像人类。",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2977.png",
      "downloads": 3359,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p><strong>Requires the latest</strong> <strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1062-sain-solarint-s-ai-modifications-full-ai-combat-system-replacement/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SAIN</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>需要最新的<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1062-sain-solarint-s-ai-modifications-full-ai-combat-system-replacement/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SAIN</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>More aggressive bots.</li>\n<li>Less accurate bots.</li>\n<li>Bosses with less good hearing.</li>\n<li>Bosses with less good eyesight.</li>\n<li>Bosses with slower reaction times.</li>\n<li>But each bot type has its own unique characteristics.</li>\n<li>Still, don’t underestimate bosses, raiders, rouges, etc.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>特色：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>更激进的BOT。</li>\n<li>更射不准的BOT。</li>\n<li>听力不那么好的BOT。</li>\n<li>视力不那么好的BOT。</li>\n<li>反应速度不那么快的BOT。</li>\n<li>但每类BOT都各有特点。</li>\n<li>依然不要小瞧BOSS/Raiders/Rouge等等</li>\n</ul>\n<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p>I mainly use these mods:</p>\n<p>我主要在用这些MOD：</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/606-spt-realism-mod/?highlight=real\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SPT REALISM MOD</a> (Discord has a beta version | Discord有测试版)</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2180-apbs-acid-s-progressive-bot-system/?highlight=acid\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">APBS - ACID’S PROGRESSIVE BOT SYSTEM</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2782-abps-acid-s-bot-placement-system/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ABPS - ACID’S BOT PLACEMENT SYSTEM</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/998-softcore-proper-singleplayer-experience-for-spt/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SOFTCORE (PROPER SINGLEPLAYER EXPERIENCE FOR SPT)</a> (still works in 3113 | 3113可以用)</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1673-raid-overhaul/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">RAID OVERHAUL</a></p>\n<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p>How to install:</p>\n<p>如何安装：</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/TKgt3VO.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TKgt3VO.gif\" alt=\"TKgt3VO.gif\" /></a></p>\n<p>If you use Mod Organizer2 to manage MOD, you can put the package into the mo2/downloads folder and install it directly.</p>\n<p>如果您使用Mod Organizer2管理MOD，那么可以把压缩包放到mo2/downloads文件夹，直接安装。</p>\n",
